OL,3,AOlivia Dean accused of copying Bill
OL,4,AWithers' Just The Two of Us
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish pop star Olivia Dean has been
OL,7,Faccused of copying the melody of Bill
OL,8,FWithers' soul classic Just The Two of
OL,9,FUs in a legal case filed in California.
OL,11,FThe complaint centres around Dean's
OL,12,Fsong I've Seen It, taken from her Brit
OL,13,FAward-winning 2025 album The Art of
OL,14,FLoving.
OL,16,FJust The Two of Us was a hit for
OL,17,FWithers in 1981, and the publishers of
OL,18,Fthe late singer's catalogue allege that
OL,19,Fthe two songs "share musical features"
OL,20,Fthat are "so striking" they cannot have
OL,21,Farisen by coincidence alone.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
