OL,3,AK-pop giants Stray Kids join BTS in
OL,4,Aboycotting the Grammys
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the world's biggest K-pop
OL,7,Fgroups, Stray Kids, are joining BTS in
OL,8,Fboycotting the 2027 Grammy Awards.
OL,10,FThe move comes after the introduction
OL,11,Fof a controversial new category for
OL,12,FAsian pop music, which critics fear
OL,13,Fwill ghettoise genres like K-Pop and
OL,14,FJ-Pop.
OL,16,FBTS announced they would not submit
OL,17,Fsongs for consideration in any category
OL,18,Fin July, saying they hoped their music
OL,19,F"can be heard and loved for what it is,
OL,20,Frather than being divided by region or
OL,21,Flanguage".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
