OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AK-pop giants Stray Kids join BTS in
OL,4,Aboycotting the Grammys
OL,5,
OL,6,FStray Kids, who recently scored their
OL,7,Fninth US number one album, have now
OL,8,Ffollowed suit. In a short statement,
OL,9,Ftheir record label JYP simply said:
OL,10,F"Stray Kids did not submit for the
OL,11,FGrammys."
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/18
